<title>BELGIUM: Customs 2000 adopted.</title>
<headline>Customs 2000 adopted.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Internal Market Council on Tuesday formally adopted the Customs 2000 programme, EU officials said.</p>
<p>The programme is aimed at stepping up cooperation between member states' customs authorities.</p>
<p>Adoption was possible after the accord during conciliation between the European Parliament and Council of Ministers on October 10.</p>
</text>
